Acknowledgements & Architectural Inspirations:
Hetzer was inspired by pioneering security, secret management, and agentic tools:
- HashiCorp Vault (HashiCorp / Mitchell Hashimoto) - The gold standard in secret management and transit encryption.
- 1Password CLI & Doppler - Pioneers of out-of-band ephemeral runtime secret injection.
- TruffleHog (Truffle Security) & Gitleaks (Zachary Rice) - High-speed regex & entropy-based secret detection.
- Anthropic Model Context Protocol (MCP) - Standardized protocol for AI agent tool integration.
- LLM-Guard (Protect AI) - Pioneer in real-time LLM input/output token scanning.
- Hermes Agent (NousResearch), Google Antigravity (AGY), Cursor, and Cline - Autonomous AI agent ecosystems that highlighted the need for credential-safety tooling.
